{
  "title": "【改訂】マンションの掲示板に「貼り紙の貼り方」が増殖してる",
  "body": "<div class=\"neko-thread\"><div class=\"neko-res-list\"><div class=\"res\" id=\"res1\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">1：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:17:00 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">うちのマンションの掲示板に「貼り紙の貼り方」という紙が貼られた。昨日は三行だったのに今朝は七行になってる。誰かこの増殖を止める方法を考えてくれ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res2\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">2：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:18:11 ID:J9dM4qN2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">貼り紙で注意すればいい</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res3\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">3：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:20:05 ID:E8mV4pZ1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">それが増殖の原因になるだろ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res4\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">4：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:22:42 ID:M4nQ6hD1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">具体的に何が書いてある？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res5\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">5：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:23:45 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">一行目「貼り紙はまっすぐ貼ること」</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res6\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">6：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:25:31 ID:D2qJ7vK5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">正論すぎる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res7\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">7：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:28:00 ID:L7pB3wS9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">二行目は？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res8\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">8：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:28:55 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">「画びょうは四隅に使用すること」</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res9\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">9：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:30:33 ID:C9wH3sF6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">掲示板のガイドラインだな</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res10\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">10：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:32:54 ID:K2vT8fL5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ここに持ち込む題材としては正しい</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res11\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">11：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:33:41 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">三行目「貼り紙に関する質問は貼り紙で行わないこと」</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res12\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">12：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:35:11 ID:B4nT8rL2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">自分を否定してるぞ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res13\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">13：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:37:24 ID:J9dM4qN2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">四行目以降が気になる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res14\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">14：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:38:03 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">「質問への回答も貼り紙で行わないこと」</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res15\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">15：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:39:25 ID:M4nQ6hD1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">誰と戦ってるんだ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res16\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">16：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:41:30 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">五行目「ただし緊急時はこの限りではない」</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res17\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">17：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:42:01 ID:D2qJ7vK5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">緊急の定義が必要だな</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res18\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">18：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:43:15 ID:L7pB3wS9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">六行目「緊急かどうかは管理人が判断する」</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res19\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">19：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:45:12 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">七行目は？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res20\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">20：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:47:52 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">「管理人への質問は貼り紙で行わないこと」</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res21\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">21：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:48:58 ID:K2vT8fL5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">管理人に直接聞けよ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res22\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">22：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:50:47 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">今朝いなかった。夜は管理室が閉まる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res23\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">23：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:53:19 ID:B4nT8rL2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">一人で書いてるなら筆跡同じだろ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res24\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">24：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:54:17 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">最初の三行は太い黒ペン。追加分は青いボールペン</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res25\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">25：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:55:58 ID:E8mV4pZ1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">もう複数犯じゃねえか</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res26\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">26：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:58:22 ID:M4nQ6hD1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">紙の余白はまだある？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res27\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">27：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/07/09(金) 21:59:12 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">下半分が空白</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res28\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">28：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 22:00:45 ID:D2qJ7vK5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">そこに書き足される予感しかしない</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res29\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">29：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 22:03:01 ID:L7pB3wS9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">何か書いて反応を見ようぜ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res30\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">30：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/07/09(金) 22:03:43 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\"><a href=\"#res29\">&gt;&gt;29</a> それやったら共犯になる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res31\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">31：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 22:05:08 ID:C9wH3sF6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">しかしルールの制定者が不明では正当性がない</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res32\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">32：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 22:07:16 ID:K2vT8fL5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">マンションの自治会はあるの？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res33\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">33：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/07/09(金) 22:07:50 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">あるけど会長は半年くらい不在らしい</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res34\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">34：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 22:09:07 ID:B4nT8rL2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">不在の会長が一番偉そう</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res35\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">35：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/07/09(金) 22:11:07 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">紙の端に署名は？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res36\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">36：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 22:13:50 ID:E8mV4pZ1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">「掲示係」ってだけ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res37\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">37：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 22:14:59 ID:M4nQ6hD1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">掲示係という役職があるのか</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res38\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">38：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/07/09(金) 22:16:51 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">聞いたことない</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res39\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">39：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 22:19:26 ID:D2qJ7vK5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">じゃあ明日まで様子見でいいだろ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res40\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">40：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/07/09(金) 22:20:27 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">念のため今日の状態を携帯で撮った</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res41\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">41：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 22:22:11 ID:G6bR2kW8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">画像見たい</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res42\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">42：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/07/09(金) 22:24:38 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ここには貼らん。住んでる場所がわかる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res43\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">43：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 22:25:31 ID:K2vT8fL5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">賢明だな</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res44\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">44：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 22:27:07 ID:F3xG9nT6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ルール八「個人情報のある貼り紙は禁止」</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res45\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">45：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 22:29:26 ID:B4nT8rL2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">お前が書くなｗ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res46\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">46：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/07/09(金) 22:30:11 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">夜の十一時。さっき見たら八行目が増えてた</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res47\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">47：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 22:31:39 ID:E8mV4pZ1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">なんて？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res48\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">48：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/07/09(金) 22:33:50 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">「掲示物の写真撮影は事前に許可を取ること」</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res49\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">49：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/09(金) 22:34:27 ID:H5sC7yP3</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\"><a href=\"#res40