div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">他人事かよ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res60\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">60：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/07/10(土) 06:39:57 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">しかも管理人、十行目を自分で書いた</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res61\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">61：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/10(土) 06:42:19 ID:D2qJ7vK5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">何て書いたんだ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res62\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">62：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/07/10(土) 06:43:07 ID:A7mK2pQ9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">「掲示係を名乗る際は管理人に届け出ること」</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res63\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">63：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">水先案名無い人</span> 2010/07/10(土) 06:44:38 ID:G6bR2kW8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">完全に参戦してる</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res64\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">64：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">1です</span> 2010/07/10(土) 06:46:52 ID